// Randomness generator file — plot beats that fit any genre.
// Lines starting with // are comments.
// The FIRST table is what rolls when the file is rolled.
// Loresmith's Plot generator rolls each table here by name.
// Roll from any note with `rdm:[@Plot Hook]`
Title: Plot Beats

Table: Plot Hook
It starts when [@Plot Inciting Incident]. The twist: [@Plot Twist].

Table: Plot Inciting Incident
a stranger arrives with a warning
a letter arrives that was never meant to be delivered
someone dies under strange circumstances
an inheritance comes with conditions
an old promise comes due
a long-lost relative reappears
they witness something they shouldn't have
their home is lost overnight
a rule is broken in front of everyone
a message arrives from someone presumed dead
an invitation arrives to a place no one returns from
a job offer is too good to refuse
a secret is overheard
the one person holding things together disappears

Table: Plot Twist
the mentor has been lying from the start
the villain is trying to prevent something worse
the prize was never real
an ally has been working for the other side
the protagonist caused the original disaster
the person they're searching for doesn't want to be found
the rules everyone believes in are wrong
two enemies want the same thing for the same reason
the trail leads back home
the victim staged it
far more time has passed than anyone realised
the plan was meant for someone else

Table: Plot Stakes
their home will be lost
someone they love will be taken from them
the truth will be buried for good
they'll become the thing they hate
their community will be torn apart
they'll lose their freedom
their name will be ruined
a family secret will come out
the world as they know it will end
they'll never get a second chance
they'll lose their sense of who they are
a promise to the dead will be broken

Table: Plot Ending
a hard-won victory that leaves a scar
bittersweet: they win, but lose what mattered most
triumphant
tragic
open-ended
a quiet return home, changed
the antagonist is redeemed
the protagonist walks away from it all
a final reveal that reframes everything
a new beginning somewhere unexpected
someone else pays the cost
love wins, at a price
